        "original_id": "1902272d-29db-5d92-8829-c652a4f2eb3e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Gareth Evans, Michael Winner, Mike Leeder\n- Works: The Raid, The Raid 2, Fearless, The Man with the Iron Fists, Man of Tai Chi, Ultimate Justice, Rogue One\n- Roles: film director, screenwriter, film editor, action choreographer, producer, restaurant critic\n- Topics: Asian cinema, international cult and action cinema\n\nFacts:\n- Michael Winner, born Robert Michael Winner on 30 October 1935 and died on 21 January 2013, was an English film director, producer, and restaurant critic for The Sunday Times.\n- Gareth Huw Evans, born in 1980, is a Welsh film director, screenwriter, film editor, and action choreographer.\n- The Raid 2 is the sequel to Gareth Evans's 2011 film The Raid.\n- Mike Leeder is regarded as an authority on Asian cinema and international cult and action cinema.\n- Mike Leeder worked on Fearless in 2006.\n- Mike Leeder worked on The Man with the Iron Fists in 2012.\n- Mike Leeder worked on Man of Tai Chi in 2013.\n- Mike Leeder worked on The Raid 2 in 2014.\n- Mike Leeder worked on Ultimate Justice in 2016.\n- Mike Leeder worked on Rogue One in 2016.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
